  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Development: Transition towards sustainable and nutritious food systems ( SIAS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to promote an inclusive and sustainable transformation of rural areas by creating opportunities for economic growth.
The development objective is to enable poor households, youth, and women to access improved and sustainable production systems, decent jobs, and better livelihoods, thereby contributing to the improvement of food systems.
This objective will be achieved through (i) efficient, resilient, and sustainable family farming to produce diverse, healthy, and nutritious food, and (ii) a conducive environment for agricultural, rural, and business opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
